<%= @alert.title %>
====================================

Severity: <%= @alert.severity.upcase %>
Device: <%= @device.device_name || 'Unknown' %> (<%= @device.target_ip %>)
Event Type: <%= @alert.alert_rule.event_type %>
Triggered At: <%= @alert.triggered_at.strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S %Z') %>

<% if @alert.message.present? %>
MESSAGE:
--------
<%= @alert.message %>

<% end %>
<% if @alert.metadata.present? %>
ADDITIONAL DATA:
----------------
<%= JSON.pretty_generate(@alert.metadata) %>

<% end %>
---
Alert ID: <%= @alert.id %>
Rule: <%= @alert.alert_rule.name %>

